# Tests

- Name tests after behavior (`test_health_ok`, `renders map shell`).
- One logical assertion group per test; mock HTTP at the API client boundary in frontend.
- Backend: use `TestClient` against `app.main:app`; no live network.

When you fix a bug or add an endpoint/UI flow, add a test in the same PR unless truly impossible.

Do not run `npm run test` or `npm run check` before finishing unless the user asks. Routine verification is `docker compose build` (see `project-workflow.mdc`).
